   "user": "O_oNevermore",
   "message": "I kept expressing egregors and gods as being abstract results of group interaction\n\nI conceptualized it as being contained within groups\n\nand you kept correcting me there and saying \"nah the group has to be subject to God the groups needs etc aren't God\"\n\nand I never really could ontologically see that but now I understand that God transcends groups\n\nthe hypothetical perfect market does not depend on any particular market",
