   "message": "You know your hypertext stuff! I never read Michael Joyce's *Afternoon, a story*, but I want to find a copy sometime and click through it myself. I was interested in the foundations of interactive fiction, since at one point I made small visual novels and also place some visual novels as among the most formative works of literature I have experienced.",
